Ta có cả $2$ mẫu số liệu $n = 2 + 5 + 7 + 3 + 3 = 20$.\\
		+ Với mẫu $M_1$ ta có:\\
		$\begin{cases}
			Q_1 \in [3; 5) \Rightarrow Q_1 = 3 + \displaystyle \frac{\displaystyle \frac{20}{4} - 2}{5} \cdot 2 = \displaystyle \frac{21}{5} \\
			Q_3 \in [7; 9) \Rightarrow Q_3 = 7 + \displaystyle \frac{\displaystyle \frac{3 \cdot 20}{4} - 14}{3} \cdot 2 = \displaystyle \frac{23}{3}
		\end{cases} \Rightarrow \Delta_{Q_1} = \displaystyle \frac{23}{3} - \displaystyle \frac{21}{5} = \displaystyle \frac{52}{15}$.\\
		+ Với mẫu $M_2$ ta có:\\
		$\begin{cases}
			Q_1 \in [4; 6) \Rightarrow Q_1 = 4 + \displaystyle \frac{\displaystyle \frac{20}{4} - 2}{5} \cdot 2 = \displaystyle \frac{26}{5} \\
			Q_3 \in [8; 10) \Rightarrow Q_3 = 8 + \displaystyle \frac{\displaystyle \frac{3 \cdot 20}{4} - 14}{3} \cdot 2 = \displaystyle \frac{26}{3}
		\end{cases} \Rightarrow \Delta_{Q_2} = \displaystyle \frac{26}{3} - \displaystyle \frac{26}{5} = \displaystyle \frac{52}{15}$.\\
		Vậy $\Delta_{Q_1} = \Delta_{Q_2}$.
